WEBVTT

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.360
<i>Hanamaru Kindergarten</i>

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:38.810
Is this what they call a slump?

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:41.990
The deadline's today.

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:46.960
Hello, Hanamaru-sensei.

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:50.450
Huh? Are you here by yourself today, Yamamoto-san?

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:54.940
Yes. The editor's home sick, so I'm here to pick up the manuscript.

00:01:56.660 --> 00:01:58.600
"A Hanamaru Gift"

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:02.980
Actually, I need some more time.

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:06.600
I just can't seem to draw what I want.

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:12.820
I know today's the deadline, but I'd rather submit something I'm satisfied with.

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:15.750
I know you came here to get the manuscript, but...

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:19.010
I understand! I'll tell the chief editor myself!

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:22.420
Don't worry about the deadline. Just work!

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:25.500
O-okay.

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:29.880
"SE Publishing"

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:33.440
Mayumi Yamamoto has returned!

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:35.480
Good work.

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:41.160
Hanamaru-sensei's manuscript!

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:43.970
He isn't done yet.

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:46.610
What? Oh well.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.000
I guess I'll have to light a fire under him.

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:52.880
What do you want?

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:56.290
It seems Hanamaru-sensei is having trouble drawing.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.800
I'll check on him again later.

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:01.140
Would that be alright?

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:08.420
Fine. I'll leave it up to you today.

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:10.380
Thank you!

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:14.660
Sure. By the way, what is that you're holding?

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:18.640
Oh, no! I forgot to give him this gift!

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:20.400
I'll go give it to him!

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:25.820
Mayumi-chan never changes.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:30.000
Yeah. She seems to be on top of things, but she's always missing something.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.120
Why can't I draw?

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:43.240
I'm causing trouble for Yamamoto-san, too.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:46.930
Yamamoto-san, huh? She's cute.

00:03:48.090 --> 00:03:51.460
She's got it together for a part-timer, and she's got so much energy.

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:55.300
I wonder if Yamamoto-san has a boyfriend.

00:03:56.370 --> 00:04:00.900
What am I thinking about? This isn't helping!

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:06.900
What do you girls want?

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:08.250
Our ball.

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:10.230
Oh, here.

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:12.280
Thanks, mister.

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:18.860
Uh, what are you girls looking at?

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:20.740
We're watching you because you're interesting.

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:22.160
Interesting?

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:24.760
You remember something and smile...

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:27.090
...then worry about something...

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:29.170
...and hang your head and sigh deeply.

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:31.940
They saw me at my worst.

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:35.560
Which means your love life must be in trouble!

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:40.280
Is it unrequited love?

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:42.310
These girls see right through me.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:45.010
So you really are in love.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:47.070
I'm sure they know now.

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:50.350
You're just like me. I love Tsuchi.

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:51.780
And now they're saying I'm one of them.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:55.220
What is your crush like?

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:57.500
Huh? What is she like?

00:04:57.910 --> 00:05:00.490
She's an energetic girl with a cute smile.

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:04.920
Being with her gives me energy.

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:07.080
Just like the sun.

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:08.960
What about the sun?

00:05:10.980 --> 00:05:14.620
I'm sorry. I forgot to give you this gift earlier.

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:17.430
How did you know I'd be here?

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:21.430
You weren't at your studio, so I thought you might be somewhere in the area.

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:24.160
I see. Sorry for making you come out here.

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:25.650
What's a gift?

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:28.720
It's a tasty delivery to cheer him up.

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:29.900
I see.

00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:31.290
I brought you cake today.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:32.480
Cake?

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:37.370
W-why don't we all have some?

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:38.750
Okay!

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:46.790
Which one do I want?

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:48.570
I want the strawberry one.

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:49.560
I want the mont blanc.

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:50.970
They're all delicious.

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:03.520
She's the sunny person you were talking about, right?

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:06.860
H-how did you know she's the girl I like?

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:11.280
I think she's the only one who doesn't know. Look.

00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:12.500
Hey, listen.

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:15.570
That person said he...

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:19.550
What's wrong?

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:21.270
N-nothing!

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:23.350
I just need to talk to these kids.

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:27.830
Listen, I can't have you saying that kind of stuff.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:29.330
We can't tell her?

00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:32.420
There's a certain order to things.

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:33.410
Order?

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:36.810
I tell Tsuchi how I feel about him every day.

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:40.080
Koume-chan confessed her love to Yu-kun, too.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:41.780
I asked him to hold me.

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:44.850
Kids these days sure are something.

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:47.800
This may sound presumptuous, but...

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:54.330
...were you thinking she would know how you felt just from your attitude?

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:58.990
Some people will never get the message that way.

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:03.040
What are they talking about?

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:05.360
You're unusually knowledgeable.

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:09.080
Yes. It's because I see something like this almost every day.

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:12.410
Are you alright?

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.670
Yes. That's odd. I wonder if I caught a cold.

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:19.000
It's better to be clear about your feelings.

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:24.640
You might be right, but there's nothing good about me.

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:26.720
There's no point in confessing.

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:29.810
He isn't very cheerful.

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:36.950
Hanamaru-sensei must be really worried about his work.

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:42.950
Hanamaru-sensei...

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:46.480
Pa-pa-pa-pa panda-cat.

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:50.280
Pa-pa-pa-pa panda-cat.

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:53.980
Pa-pa-pa-pa panda-cat.

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:57.720
Pa-pa-pa-pa panda-cat.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.110
This is...

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:00.350
The panda-cat exercise.

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:03.970
Everyone has so much fun doing the panda-cat exercise.

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:06.980
I love the panda-cat exercise, too.

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:09.910
Cheer up, mister.

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:12.740
It seems you're very popular among kindergarten students.

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:21.730
Thanks. I feel better.

00:08:23.220 --> 00:08:27.130
I even know all of the second dance, too. Cool, huh?

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:29.330
Really? Wow.

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:33.010
Sensei, I suddenly remembered I have something to do. Excuse me.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:37.750
She left.

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:38.750
Yeah.

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:40.670
I guess we should go, too.

00:08:40.930 --> 00:08:41.650
Yeah.

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:45.670
I've got to get back to work, too.

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:51.170
Thank you for going shopping with me.

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.780
Not at all. They were things we use at the kindergarten.

00:08:54.230 --> 00:08:57.180
Besides, I did it for you.

00:08:57.820 --> 00:09:02.020
Why don't I treat you to dinner to thank you?

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:03.200
Dinner?

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:06.690
Dinner with Yamamoto-sensei? Awesome.

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:08.780
It might be to thank me, but she extended the invitation.

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:11.760
Would that be a problem for you?

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:14.990
No, no. There's no problem at all.

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:17.510
I'd be delighted to have dinner with you.

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:19.580
Really? That's great.

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:21.190
Nana-chan!

00:09:23.590 --> 00:09:24.550
Mayumi...

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:27.380
I'm glad I found you.

00:09:27.720 --> 00:09:29.320
"Nana-chan?" Who is this girl?

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:31.210
This is my younger sister Mayumi.

00:09:32.770 --> 00:09:34.310
Nana-chan, who is this person?

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:36.230
He's Tsuchida-sensei from the kindergarten.

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:38.560
So this is the guy.

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:42.260
I can really tell she's your sister. She's cute.

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:45.070
That subtle attitude.

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:48.340
Tsuchida-san must like Nana-chan.

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:52.000
Oh, no. I have a favor to ask of you, Nana-chan.

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:53.150
A favor?

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:59.530
Okay, I'll ask the kindergarten director.

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:01.420
Yeah, as soon as you can.

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:05.250
But Nana-chan, aren't you shopping with Tsuchida-san?

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:10.930
Oh, it's fine. I'm not sure what's going on, but you're in a hurry, right?

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:12.820
We can do something some other time.

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:15.180
Is that so? I'm sorry.

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:17.390
We'll have dinner some other time.

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:19.060
Thank you.

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:24.160
There goes Yamamoto-sensei.

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:27.390
I really wanted to eat dinner with her.

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:37.260
Sensei, sensei!

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:38.330
Yamamoto-san?

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:42.320
What is this?

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:45.170
They're all things made by kindergarten students.

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:49.090
Take a look at this. They made this during drawing class.

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:50.800
These are great.

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:53.060
That's a lot of panda-cats.

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:55.020
These are amazing.

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:59.720
Panda-cat is very popular at the kindergarten where my sister works.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:02.200
Really?

00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:07.350
Did she do this for me?

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:09.810
Look, a clay panda-cat.

00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:14.890
Yamamoto-san asked her sister for help because I was directionless.

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:17.780
This girl really is something.

00:11:20.230 --> 00:11:23.470
I'm starting to feel motivated.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:25.790
Thank you, Yamamoto-san.

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:27.960
Sensei, you cheered up.

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:31.540
I'll definitely finish some time tomorrow.

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:32.810
Okay.

00:11:34.020 --> 00:11:36.890
I'll take this love one step at a time.

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:43.920
So Hanamaru-sensei's manuscript was on time.

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:46.980
Yeah, thanks to your help, Nana-chan.

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:50.980
He was so happy he invited me to see a movie.

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:53.210
Oh, really?

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:57.340
Hanamaru-sensei is so kind. He doesn't need to thank me.

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:01.250
Right. Hanamaru-sensei is a kind person.

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:05.870
Could Hanamaru-sensei have asked her out on a date?

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:09.750
You were about to go to dinner with Tsuchida-san yesterday, right?

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:12.060
Sorry for getting in the way.

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:14.820
I've got to make it up to Tsuchida-sensei.

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:17.010
He was excited about going to dinner.

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:19.380
I'm sure he was.

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:21.890
He must have been really hungry.

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:24.280
Huh? M-maybe...

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:27.150
No, no, Nana-chan!

00:12:27.150 --> 00:12:31.700
No matter how you look at it, Tsuchida-san was happy about going to dinner with you!

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:38.020
She's still the same old Nana-chan.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:41.100
Mayumi's still the same old Mayumi.

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:42.790
Tsuchida-san.

00:12:43.350 --> 00:12:44.530
Hanamaru-sensei.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:47.170
This can't be easy for him.

00:12:50.780 --> 00:12:52.590
"Sakura Class"

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:00.140
Nice drawings, everyone.

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:04.440
"What I want to be when I grow up"

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:06.850
"A Hanamaru Dream"

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:09.730
Ryota and Kenichi, are those animal rangers?

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:13.160
I'm going to be Animal Red!

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:14.360
I'm Red, too!

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:16.220
I see.

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:26.310
You want to be a soccer player, Toshiaki?

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:26.990
Yes.

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:28.150
A soccer player?

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:29.030
Really?

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:33.430
Perhaps that's not possible for me.

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:34.960
After all, I'm a slow runner.

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:37.970
Not at all. That's not true.

00:13:38.270 --> 00:13:39.640
If you start training now, it'll be fine.

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:41.100
I'm done!

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:43.110
Let's see.

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:46.510
I want to be your bride, Tsuchi.

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:49.650
We'll live in a house with a yard and have a doggie.

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:51.650
What a big house.

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:55.900
Our house will have a fireplace, and you'll be able to see the ocean from the window.

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:59.650
I want lots of kids, too.

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:02.150
I don't make that much money.

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:08.590
I'll wear a frilly white apron and cook dinner and wait for you to come home.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:10.180
And...

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:16.340
I'm home.

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:20.220
Welcome home, honey.

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:25.990
You'll always be a little girl.

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:33.550
Would you like to have dinner or take a bath? Or maybe...

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.700
...maybe you'd like to take a bath together?

00:14:36.970 --> 00:14:38.050
Alright!

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:42.400
I love you, darling!

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:43.830
I love you, too.

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:48.540
Are we getting naked the second I get home?

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:51.500
Yeah. Mommy and daddy are always like this.

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:54.330
Sakura-senpai? And sensei, too?

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:57.570
I help wash my parents' backs, too.

00:14:57.630 --> 00:14:58.920
I see.

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:01.100
What about you, Koume?

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:04.720
I still have lots of things I want to be.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:05.890
What am I going to do?

00:15:06.370 --> 00:15:08.500
If you have a lot, you can draw all of them.

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:09.880
All of them?

00:15:09.990 --> 00:15:14.250
I want to be a baker...

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:16.080
Could I get a strawberry cake?

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:17.070
Yes.

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:18.800
And a florist...

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:20.070
Could I get some flowers?

00:15:20.110 --> 00:15:20.670
Yes.

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:21.760
Where's the cake?

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:23.060
Yes.

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:24.830
And a toy store employee...

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:26.070
Do you have panda-cats?

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:26.930
My flowers.

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:27.620
My cake.

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:28.360
My panda-cat.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:28.990
Flowers.

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:29.520
Cake.

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:31.340
And a bride...

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:33.280
Koume-chan, the wedding ceremony's starting.

00:15:33.730 --> 00:15:34.250
Okay.

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:35.140
Where's my cake?

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:35.860
Panda-cat.

00:15:35.860 --> 00:15:36.530
Flowers.

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:37.340
Cake.

00:15:37.340 --> 00:15:38.060
Panda-cat.

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:38.720
Flowers.

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:39.910
The ceremony's starting.

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:48.800
What's wrong?

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:50.990
It's hard having so many.

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:52.180
I see.

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:54.400
Did you finish your drawing, Hiiragi?

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:55.530
Yes.

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:58.900
I'd like to be an astronaut.

00:15:58.900 --> 00:15:59.610
See you later.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:03.800
I'd like to visit various stars and have encounters with the unknown...

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:06.760
...meet all kinds of aliens...

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.690
...overcome many challenges...

00:16:16.110 --> 00:16:17.110
Overcome them.

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:18.890
Overcome them...

00:16:19.280 --> 00:16:22.730
...and then we'll all go stargazing.

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:26.000
That's wonderful, Hiiragi-san.

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:29.140
Adventures in space, huh? It's great to have dreams.

00:16:29.240 --> 00:16:33.400
But to become an astronaut, I'll need to graduate from a school of natural sciences...

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:35.580
...and three years of hands-on experience.

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:37.670
I must be physically and mentally fit...

00:16:37.670 --> 00:16:39.910
...and be fluent in English.

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:43.030
Therefore, I must use my limited time productively.

00:16:45.570 --> 00:16:47.460
Sh-she's being realistic.

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:48.610
Hey, Tsuchi.

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:51.280
Why did you become a teacher?

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:52.370
Me?

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:53.940
Well, I...

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:02.170
What am I going to do with my life?

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:04.130
I'd like to find interesting work.

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:07.250
Napping, brother?

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:09.300
No, I'm thinking.

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:11.700
Come play with me.

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:12.750
Later.

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:14.570
Will you really play with me later?

00:17:15.150 --> 00:17:16.280
I will.

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:17.630
Okay.

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:25.240
I know, I could work with children.

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:27.940
As a kindergarten teacher, I'd have lots of time off, too.

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:30.970
Maybe I'd meet a young female teacher.

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:35.100
Tsuchida-sensei, could you help me over here?

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:37.630
It's so nice to have a man around to help.

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:42.480
You're eating a convenience store lunch? I'll make something for you.

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:45.080
Don't you have a girlfriend, Tsuchida-sensei?

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:47.910
Maybe I'll volunteer for the position.

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:50.810
No fair! I volunteer myself, too.

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:54.090
Me, too! I've always thought Tsuchida-sensei was good looking.

00:17:58.980 --> 00:18:01.260
I've always liked children.

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:07.270
Thinking I could do something to improve the futures of children, I became a child-care worker.

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:14.240
When a right handed person looks up to the right, he is lying.

00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:17.840
"Faculty Office"

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:19.800
The reason you became a teacher?

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:22.410
The children asked you that?

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:24.420
I didn't know what to say.

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:28.220
I bet you thought it'd be an easy job with plenty of time off.

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:29.680
That sounds about...

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:35.980
That's not it at all. I thought it would be a job worth doing.

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:40.330
Why did you become a teacher, Nana-chan?

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:42.240
Me?

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:44.070
I'd like to hear the answer to that, too.

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:50.320
There was a wonderful teacher at the kindergarten I attended.

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:53.350
She was kind and always seemed to be having fun.

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:56.170
Being with her made me so happy.

00:18:56.960 --> 00:19:00.920
I wanted to become a teacher just like her.

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:03.830
That sounds very like you, Yamamoto-sensei.

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:07.920
Sounds like you've fulfilled your childhood dream.

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:10.920
I still have a long way to go.

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:14.170
Why did you become a teacher, Kakogawa-sensei?

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:17.780
Me? It's difficult to sum up in a word, but...

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:20.810
...I guess I thought it was a job worth getting into.

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:24.450
My guidance counselor recommended I become a teacher.

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:26.340
I see.

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:29.530
We've all got our own reasons.

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:31.400
What about you, Kawashiro-sensei?

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:34.080
Me? I...

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:40.290
Apparently, Kawashiro-chan thought she wouldn't look as small surrounded by kindergarten students.

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:45.800
There you have it. Of course, I do enjoy working with children.

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:48.060
I see.

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:52.300
I chose this job because of my interests and practicality.

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:53.380
Your interests?

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:56.470
Kusano-sensei, aren't you into macho men?

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:57.660
Yes.

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:02.770
If you want to live surrounded by muscles, shouldn't you have become a high school teacher?

00:20:03.230 --> 00:20:04.300
Don't be foolish!

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:08.250
Kids these days are a bunch of spineless wimps. They aren't worth my time.

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:10.320
By the time they're in high school, it's too late.

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:14.460
I start them on the path to developing strong bodies...

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:17.390
...and teach them the joys of physical exercise.

00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:23.390
Ten years from now, my students will become healthy adults.

00:20:25.590 --> 00:20:26.790
Are you serious?

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:28.250
Pretty serious.

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:31.590
W-what's wrong with her?

00:20:35.800 --> 00:20:36.940
Hey, Tsuchida-kun.

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:39.270
Why don't you come to my apartment tonight?

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:40.420
What?

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:42.240
It's not like you've got anything to do.

00:20:42.460 --> 00:20:44.740
"A Hanamaru Night"

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:50.350
Kusano-sensei doesn't like me, does she?

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:54.330
No, no. There's no way I'm her type.

00:20:55.210 --> 00:20:57.400
Besides, I've got Yamamoto-sensei.

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:01.470
We're here.

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:10.020
This is it! This scene is great!

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:13.050
Great? You mean this?

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:17.790
Yeah, this! This scene is the best!

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:21.770
"The best?" He's just swinging a sword around.

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:25.650
But look at the muscles on his back when he does it.

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:28.270
Hold on. Let me rewind.

00:21:29.610 --> 00:21:33.120
Did you invite me over to show me this video?

00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:36.740
Well, Kawashiro-chan said she wasn't interested at all.

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:38.270
Of course not.

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:39.110
I'm not...

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:41.220
His muscles here. Look at his back.

00:21:42.040 --> 00:21:43.480
Isn't it amazing?

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:46.830
You're right.

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:49.300
What is she making me say?

00:21:51.970 --> 00:21:54.050
I knew you'd get into it.

00:21:56.480 --> 00:21:59.810
Look at this. Check out his powerful muscles.

00:23:30.480 --> 00:23:31.430
Hanamaru here.

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:32.210
Mayumi here.

00:23:32.210 --> 00:23:34.120
I'm glad your manuscript was on time, sensei.

00:23:34.120 --> 00:23:35.640
Thanks to you, Yamamoto-san.

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:37.190
Maybe you'd like to get dinner some...

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:38.000
We're out of time.

00:23:38.700 --> 00:23:40.660
You're next, Tsuchida-sensei.

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:41.530
I've got it.

00:23:41.530 --> 00:23:44.780
Next week's episode is about a cheering squad and a confession. Don't miss it!

00:23:42.300 --> 00:23:43.540
"A Hanamaru Cheering Squad"

00:23:43.540 --> 00:23:44.780
"A Hanamaru Confession"

00:23:44.780 --> 00:23:49.660
"See you next week!"
